              "ImageDescription": {
                "value": "Oxbow Bend outlook in the <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Grand_Teton_National_Park\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Grand Teton National Park\">Grand Teton National Park</a>. View over the <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Snake_River\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Snake River\">Snake River</a> to the <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mount_Moran\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Mount Moran\">Mount Moran</a> with the <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Skillet_Glacier\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Skillet Glacier\">Skillet Glacier</a> (12,605 ft/3,842 m), <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bivouac_Peak\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Bivouac Peak\">Bivouac Peak</a> (10,825 ft/3,299 m) and <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eagles_Rest_Peak\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Eagles Rest Peak\">Eagles Rest Peak</a> (11,258 ft/3,431 m) in the <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Teton_Range\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Teton Range\">Teton Range</a>, <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wyoming\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Wyoming\">Wyoming</a>, <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/United_States\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:United States\">United States</a>.",
